### Logs Showing the Issue
```
INFO  2026-03-29T01:28:32 +5ms service=config path=/home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode.json loading
INFO  2026-03-29T01:28:32 +0ms service=config path=/home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc loading
# Both lookups FAILED - files not in expected location
