## Fix Applied

### Step 1: Backup
```bash
cp -r /home/leviathan/.config/opencode /home/leviathan/.config/opencode.backup.before-fix-20260329-0544
```

### Step 2: Move Config Files
```bash
mv /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode/opencode.json /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/
mv /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode/opencode-ultra.json /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/
mv /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode/skills /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/
```

### Step 3: Update Dependencies
Updated `/home/leviathan/.config/opencode/package.json`:
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@opencode-ai/plugin": "1.3.4",
    "opencode-ultra": "0.9.9"  # ← Added
  }
}
```

### Step 4: Install Plugin
```bash
cd /home/leviathan/.config/opencode && bun install
# Installed: @opencode-ai/plugin@1.3.4, opencode-ultra@0.9.9
```

### Step 5: Clean Up
```bash
rm -rf /home/leviathan/.config/opencode/opencode/
```

## Verification

### After Fix
```bash
$ opencode debug config | grep -A2 '"plugin"'
  "plugin": [
    "opencode-ultra"  # ← LOADED!
  ],

$ opencode debug config | grep '"default_agent"'
  "default_agent": "sisyphus"  # ← RESTORED!

$ timeout 5 opencode run --agent sisyphus "Test"
[opencode-ultra] ENTRY — plugin loading {
  directory: "/home/leviathan",
}
[opencode-ultra] Agents registered {
  agents: [ "sisyphus", "oracle", "explore", "librarian", "multimodal-looker", "metis", "momus",
    "atlas", "hephaestus", "scout"
  ],
}
> sisyphus · glm-5
Sisyphus is available and operational.
```

